# BIM Module (`backend/src/bim`)

## Purpose

This module handles functionalities related to Building Information Modeling (BIM). This could involve processing BIM data, generating models or reports, or integrating with BIM software/platforms.

## Main Components

- `controllers/`: BIM-specific controllers.
- `generators/`: Code for generating BIM-related outputs (e.g., models, files).
- `models/`: Data models specific to BIM.
- `routes/`: API routes for BIM functionalities.
- `rules/`: Business rules or validation logic for BIM data.
- `services/`: Business logic services for BIM operations.
- `templates/`: Templates used for BIM data generation or presentation.
- `types/`: TypeScript type definitions for BIM data structures.
- `utils/`: Utility functions specific to BIM tasks.

## Key Functionalities (to be detailed)

- BIM data parsing and processing.
- Generation of BIM models or data files.
- Integration with external BIM tools or services.
- API endpoints for BIM operations.

## Interactions (to be detailed)

- How BIM routes are integrated into the main application.
- Dependencies on other core services (e.g., project service, file service).
- Data exchange formats used (e.g., IFC, BCF).
